# Copy to .env — setup.sh does this for you and never overwrites an existing one.
# .env is gitignored. Keep secrets out of this file.

# --- LLM provider -----------------------------------------------------------
# Which provider adapter to construct. See docs/adr/0006-llm-provider-abstraction.md.
# One of: openai | anthropic
LLM_PROVIDER=

# API key for the provider selected above.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Model routing ----------------------------------------------------------
# Two roles, deliberately separate so the cheap job never silently rides on the
# expensive model. Left empty here (STATE.md D-1): the values depend on what the
# operator's account can actually reach, so setup.sh names them rather than
# guessing, and you fill them in here.
#
# MODEL_EXTRACT   cheap, mechanical: evidence bundle -> facts + evidence_ids.
#                 High volume, one call per candidate, schema-constrained.
# MODEL_ANALYSE   judgement-heavy: query planning (stage 1a) and anything that
#                 needs to weigh rather than transcribe. Low volume.
#
# Neither model ever produces a score, a call, or memo prose (ADR-0002).
MODEL_EXTRACT=
MODEL_ANALYSE=

# --- Optional ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Unauthenticated GitHub API is 60 requests/hour; a token raises it to 5000.
# Not required — the pipeline degrades to lower coverage without it.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
